OL,3,GNEWSASanta trains to get BSL
OL,4,Ainterpreter for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage railway will have a British
OL,7,FSign Language interpreter for children
OL,8,Fon its Santa Special trains for the
OL,9,Ffirst time later this year.
OL,11,FThe East Lancashire Railway (ELR) said
OL,12,Fthe festive trains operate thanks to a
OL,13,Fteam of more than 800 volunteers to
OL,14,Fmake "a welcoming and magical
OL,15,Fexperience for as many people as
OL,16,Fpossible".
OL,18,FThree years ago it ran its first
OL,19,Fexperience adapted for those with
OL,20,Fspecial educational needs, including
OL,21,Ftoned down lighting, quiet carriages
OL,22,Fand less "hustle and bustle".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
