OL,3,GNEWSASanta trains to get BSL
OL,4,Ainterpreter for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FELR chairman, Mike Kelly, said the
OL,7,Frailway wants "every visitor, whatever
OL,8,Ftheir additional needs or challenges"
OL,9,Fto experience "the wonder and
OL,10,Fexcitement of Christmas".
